      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. it seems like a lot of the literature basically agrees that religious ties are the backbone of social cohesion. do you have any info on the specific mechanisms they use to prevent societal fragmentation? like, how exactly do they keep people from drifting apart in a secular age?",
